@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = seu_token_jwt_aqui

### Obter status de limite do cartão
GET {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}/limit-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obter status de limite de todos os cartões do usuário
GET {{baseUrl}}/cards/limit-status/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar limite do cartão
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}/limit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "limit": 5000
}

### Atualizar percentual de alerta
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}/alert-percentage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alertPercentage": 80
}

### Ativar/Desativar alerta
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}/alert-enabled
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true
}

### Verificar alertas e enviar notificações
POST {{baseUrl}}/cards/check-alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
